<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE - Samsung Aero H1 net turns to loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Samsung Aero H1 net turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				    -341 vs 150</p>
<p>    Net					  -11.09 vs 4.17</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			-10.89 vs 4.17</p>
<p>    Turnover				   693.27 vs 625.65</p>
<p>Note - Samsung Aerospace Industries Co Ltd, a unit of the Samsung Group, is a producer of aircraft parts and components. The figures were provided by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5645</p>
